# Recorded input for the splitter example page (widgets/splitter.zig, `Page`), at 320 x 200 in
# the default theme: the container at 8..292 x 8..112, split at 30% with the handle at
# 93..99. Keys are USB HID codes: 79 Right, 74 Home, 77 End (format: input.Replay).
# 0: rest
frame
viewport 320 200
dt 0.016
pointer 300 190
# 1: hover the handle
frame
pointer 96 60
# 2: press it: it takes focus
frame
buttons left
# 3: drag to the middle of the container: split 0.5
frame
pointer 150 60
# 4: release
frame
buttons
# 5: Right: 0.55
frame
press 79
# 6: End: 1, the second pane shrinks to the handle
frame
press 77
# 7: Home: 0, the first pane disappears
frame
press 74
